+### [CUDA Voxelizer Pipeline](19191-cuda-voxelizer-pipeline.md)
+A GPU-accelerated rendering and gradient computation method for 3D Gaussian Splatting that voxelizes 3D Gaussians into a 3D grid, sorts them per tile using radix sort, and renders/backpropagates gradients via tile-based blending. It differs from standard tile-based rasterization by explicitly constructing a 3D voxel grid to manage Gaussian spatial distribution and using a dedicated preprocessing phase to compute norms, depths, and conic opacities before binning. Choose it for voxel-based spatial management.
 
